<title>SLOVENIA: ALPINE SKIING-VON GRUENIGEN WINS GIANT SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-VON GRUENIGEN WINS GIANT SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>KRANJSKA GORA, Slovenia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael von Gruenigen of Switzerland won a men's World Cup giant slalom on Sunday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Siegfried Voglreiter of Austria was second with Kjetil-Andre Aamodt of Norway third, also provisionally.</p>
</text>
